# @keyobject/aws-kms-@TARGET@

> [!NOTE]
> This is an internal platform package for
> [`@keyobject/aws-kms`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@keyobject/aws-kms). It is
> installed automatically as an exact-version optional dependency. Do not
> install it directly.

This package contains the prebuilt OpenSSL provider for `@TARGET@`. See the
[main project](https://github.com/panva/keyobject-aws-kms) for installation,
usage, supported keys, and security guidance.
